spice
* Voltage Sources
V1 6 0 DC V1
VSD 5 0 DC Vsd

* Capacitors
C1 6 2 C1_Value
C2 2 0 C2_Value
CL 2 3 CL_Value

* Control Signals
VBB 2 5 DC VBB_Value

* Assuming ideal OpAmp (indicated as CMC in the schematics)
* The OpAmp is configured such that:
* - Non-inverting terminal is node 2
* - Inverting terminal is node 5
* - Output is node 4
E1 4 0 2 5 100k

* Control Signals \( \Phi_1, \Phi_2 \)
S1 6 2 V1 5 Phi1
S2 5 2 C1 5 Phi2
